wb-tsgo (7.1.0~dev.20260813) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: tsgo, Microsoft's native Go implementation of the
    TypeScript compiler (github.com/microsoft/typescript-go), built from
    source at the version pinned in go.mod
    (v0.0.0-20260813172707-3d981a41cced, "Version 7.1.0-dev") and
    installed unmodified as /usr/bin/tsgo. A tsc-compatible standalone CLI;
    also the default -tsgo compiler of wb-rules, which uses it to
    transpile and type-check TypeScript rule files.

